<details class='sub-section' id='sub_1'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>02 · 上升、跌落、翻倒与跨越 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Going up, Falling down & Turning over</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>52 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>垂直轴向运动用 UP/DOWN；重心越过支点呈弧线倒下用 OVER（fall/topple over）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
