<details class='sub-section' id='sub_2'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>03 · 追赶、跟随、散开与聚拢 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Catching up, Keeping up & Spreading out</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>22 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>缩短与前方目标的距离直至并驾齐驱用 UP（catch/keep up with）；从中心向四周辐射展开用 OUT（spread/fan out）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>come <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 9 个核心义项'>7/9</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>gather or bring together</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>muster, rally</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Muster the courage to do something.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span>She rallied her intellect.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>③</span>Summon all your courage.</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>round <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>seek out and bring together</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>gather, garner</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span><b>Round</b> <b>up</b> some loyal followers.</div></div></div></td></tr>
