<details class='sub-section' id='sub_3'><summary class='sub-header'><span><span class='arrow-icon'>▶</span>04 · 穿戴、脱下、拾起与放下 <span style='font-weight:400;font-size:0.86em;color:#cbd5e1;margin-left:8px;'>Putting on, Taking off & Picking up</span></span><span class='sub-meta'>143 义项</span></summary><div class='epe-explain-box'>🎭 <b>场景认知导读：</b>衣物接触并附着于身体表面用 ON¹（put/slip/try on）；衣物脱离身体表面用 OFF（take/kick/throw off）。</div><table><tr><th width='21%'>Phrasal Verb • 语法与语域</th><th width='24%'>🎯 English Definition (WordNet)</th><th width='14%'>🔄 Single-Word Verb</th><th width='41%'>💬 Authentic Examples</th></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Informal'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>take <span class='pt-highlight'>off</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 8 个核心义项'>2/8</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Informal' title='🤖 自动判定依据：语料库日常/小说会话分布活跃 + 作为正式词 [remove] 的日常短语替身' style='cursor:help;'>💬 口语/日常 (Informal)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>take away or remove</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>remove, withdraw</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>📌</span><b>Take</b> that weight <b>off</b> me!</div></div></div></td></tr>
<tr data-sep='Separable' data-reg='Neutral'><td><div class='word-line'><span class='word'>make <span class='pt-highlight'>up</span></span><span class='sense-badge' title='该短语共有 9 个核心义项'>4/9</span></div><div class='badge-stack'><span class='sep-Separable'>🟢 可拆分 (v. + O + adv.)</span><span class='reg-Neutral' title='🤖 自动判定依据：标准通用语域 (对应: tidy)' style='cursor:help;'>⚖️ 通用/中性 (Neutral)</span></div></td><td><span class='cn-precise' style='font-weight:600;color:#1e293b;'>put in order or neaten</span></td><td><span class='eq-verb'>tidy, neaten</span></td><td><div class='ex-list'><div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>①</span>Make the bed.</div></div>
<div class='ex-item'><div class='ex-en'><span class='ex-num'>②</span><b>Make</b> <b>up</b> a room.</div></div></div></td></tr>
